#. ja: ユールモアの基部に広がる貧民街。「光の氾濫」によって、遠洋航海が不可能になったことで無用の長物と化した外洋船を、建材として利用することで街並みが形成されている。中には、船の一部をそのまま利用した建物もある
#. de: Das Armenviertel der Stadt des Vergnügens. Die Abgehängten leben in alten Ozeanschiffen, die nutzlos geworden waren, nachdem die Lichtflut alle Kontinente bis auf Norvrandt verschlungen hatte
#. fr: Ce quartier pauvre qui s'étend à la base d'Eulmore a été créé en recyclant le bois des épaves de navires, devenus inutiles après le déluge de Lumière du fait que toute navigation en haute mer a été rendue impossible. Certains vaisseaux sont même utilisés tels quels comme habitations.
#. column 13: The Derelicts
#. column 14: In my wanderings through the city of Eulmore, I found myself pausing in wide-eyed wonder as I looked out upon the view before me. I knew that I must capture this sight in ink, lest others simply pass it by.
msgctxt "Adventure:2162898:0:15"
msgid "This shanty town provides shelter for the destitute masses which huddle around the base of Eulmore. Many have built shacks with planks scavenged from the derelicts─sea vessels left to rot once the Flood of Light made the oceans impassable─while others simply squat in whatever remains of the ships' broken hulls."
msgstr "В трущобах у подножия Юлмора нашли приют нищие и бездомные. Одни сколотили лачуги из досок, снятых с брошенных кораблей, сгнивших после того, как Потоп Света сделал океаны непроходимыми. Другие поселились прямо в разбитых корпусах."

#. ja: ユールモア軍司令本部
#. de: Hauptquartier der Hochrühmlichen Armee
#. fr: Quartiers généraux eulmoriens
#. column 14: In my wanderings through the city of Eulmore, I found myself pausing in wide-eyed wonder as I looked out upon the view before me. I knew that I must capture this sight in ink, lest others simply pass it by.
#. column 15: The offices of the vaunted Eulmoran military. Though once ensconced in the Canopy above, the change in policy which accompanied Lord Vauthry's investiture as ruler saw the army fall in prominence, its officers relegated to the mid-layer chambers which once served as the city's gaol.
msgctxt "Adventure:2162899:0:13"
msgid "Eulmoran Army Headquarters"
msgstr "Штаб армии Юлмора"

#. ja: ――この景色、後世に伝ふ。\nユールモアのいずこかにあり。\nその場で見渡す。
#. de: Bei der Erkundung von Eulmore gelangte ich an einen spektakulären Aussichtspunkt. Und was ich erblickte, wird die Barden bis ans Ende aller Tage inspirieren zu Liedern und Weisen.
#. fr: C'est au cours de pérégrinations à Eulmore que j'ai découvert cet endroit offrant une vue splendide sur un fantastique paysage. Sa beauté était telle que j'ai ressenti la nécessité de le partager.
#. column 13: Eulmoran Army Headquarters
#. column 15: The offices of the vaunted Eulmoran military. Though once ensconced in the Canopy above, the change in policy which accompanied Lord Vauthry's investiture as ruler saw the army fall in prominence, its officers relegated to the mid-layer chambers which once served as the city's gaol.
msgctxt "Adventure:2162899:0:14"
msgid "In my wanderings through the city of Eulmore, I found myself pausing in wide-eyed wonder as I looked out upon the view before me. I knew that I must capture this sight in ink, lest others simply pass it by."
msgstr "Странствуя по Юлмору, я замер, поражённый открывшимся видом. Его стоило запечатлеть на бумаге, чтобы другие не прошли мимо такой красоты."

#. ja: 精強さで知られるユールモア軍の司令本部。以前は上層の「樹梢の層」に本部を構えていたが、ヴァウスリーの元首着任に伴う政策路線の変更により軍の意義が低下し、元々、監獄だったこの層に移設された経緯を持つ
#. de: Die Schlagkraft der Truppen von Eulmore war berüchtigt. Einst befand sich das Hauptquartier in der Baumkrone, doch unter Lord Vauthrys Herrschaft verlor die Armee an Stellenwert und wurde in einen unteren Abschnitt, der einst als Kerker diente, verlegt.
#. fr: L'état-major de la puissante armée d'Eulmore siégeait avant à La Voûte, mais le changement de politique qui s'est opéré avec la nomination de Vauthry au poste de gouverneur l'a relégué à cet endroit, qui servait notamment de geôles autrefois.
#. column 13: Eulmoran Army Headquarters
#. column 14: In my wanderings through the city of Eulmore, I found myself pausing in wide-eyed wonder as I looked out upon the view before me. I knew that I must capture this sight in ink, lest others simply pass it by.
msgctxt "Adventure:2162899:0:15"
msgid "The offices of the vaunted Eulmoran military. Though once ensconced in the Canopy above, the change in policy which accompanied Lord Vauthry's investiture as ruler saw the army fall in prominence, its officers relegated to the mid-layer chambers which once served as the city's gaol."
msgstr "Здесь располагается прославленная армия Юлмора. Когда-то штаб занимал верхний ярус, но после того, как лорд Вотри взошёл на престол, политика изменилась, и армия утратила былое значение. Офицеров переселили в помещения среднего яруса, где прежде находилась городская тюрьма."

#. ja: キャバレー・ビーハイヴ
#. de: Lustspielhaus Bienenstock
#. fr: La Ruche
#. column 14: In my wanderings through the city of Eulmore, I found myself pausing in wide-eyed wonder as I looked out upon the view before me. I knew that I must capture this sight in ink, lest others simply pass it by.
#. column 15: The Beehive is a place of noise and excitement─a little sting to invigorate the safe, pampered lives of Eulmore's free citizens. Regardless of gender, this establishment's bonded workers are often called “honeybees,” while the owner reigns above them as “queen.”
msgctxt "Adventure:2162900:0:13"
msgid "The Beehive"
msgstr "Пчелиный улей"

#. ja: ――この景色、後世に伝ふ。\nユールモアのいずこかにあり。\nその場で見渡す。
#. de: Bei der Erkundung von Eulmore gelangte ich an einen spektakulären Aussichtspunkt. Und was ich erblickte, wird die Barden bis ans Ende aller Tage inspirieren zu Liedern und Weisen.
